# SCSS Quick Reference

## Critical Rules
```scss
// ❌ NEVER
font-size: 18px;
@media (min-width: 768px) { }
@media (width < $md) { }

// ✅ ALWAYS
gap: rem-calc(16);              // Fixed values
font-size: fluid(16, 24);       // Responsive values
@media (width >= $md) { }       // Mobile-first only
```

## Functions
```scss
rem-calc(16)                    // Fixed: 1rem
fluid(16, 24)                   // Responsive: min 16px, max 24px
fluid(16, 24, md, xl)          // Custom breakpoints
```

## Breakpoints
```scss
$sm: 36rem;      // 576px
$md: 48rem;      // 768px
$lg: 62rem;      // 992px
$xl: 75rem;      // 1200px
$xxl: 87.5rem;   // 1400px
```

## Import Order
In `style.scss`:
1. Mixins (rem-calc first)
2. Config (maps, colors, variables)
3. Base styles (reset, reboot)
4. JS plugins (swiper, lenis)
5. Components (header, footer)
6. ACF blocks
7. Templates
8. Helpers & utilities (last)

## Mobile-First Pattern
```scss
.component {
	font-size: fluid(14, 16);    // Mobile default

	@media (width >= $md) {
		font-size: fluid(16, 20); // Tablet+
	}

	@media (width >= $lg) {
		font-size: fluid(20, 24); // Desktop+
	}
}
```

## Exceptions
- `1px` borders allowed
- Box shadows allowed
- Under 4px values allowed
